    WinShell class >> editorMessage: msg wParam: wp lParam: lp [ ^#defwindowproc ]
    WinShell class >> editorCaret [ ^1 ]
    "WG6c-2b's selection; 107 overrides. 106 paints the rectangles and loads
     BEFORE 107, so an empty collection here is what makes that file complete
     on its own rather than merely complete in practice."
    WinShell class >> editorSelectionRectsAtX: x y: y [ ^OrderedCollection new ]
