    "WG6c-2b's clipboard; 108 overrides. Declared here because 107 DISPATCHES
     them (Ctrl-C/X/V) and loads before 108 does — a layer that stopped at 107
     would otherwise answer doesNotUnderstand to a keystroke."
    WinShell class >> editorCopy [ ^#defwindowproc ]
